                  "content": "Balances come from your banks' messages. When a message has none, k adds up the payments since the last figure it saw, so the number is marked estimated. Set it yourself any time. Cash goes up with ATM withdrawals and down with cash payments you add; set it after counting your wallet.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
